WEBVTT

00:00:21.646 --> 00:00:22.946
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Aren’t you working today?

00:00:23.532 --> 00:00:26.584
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> No, I took the day off.

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.655
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Ben and I had a big argument last night.

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.641
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> I’m sorry to hear that.

00:00:54.181 --> 00:00:55.029
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I thought you’d be here.

00:00:57.117 --> 00:00:58.959
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Well, here I am.

00:01:10.588 --> 00:01:11.308
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I’m sorry.

00:01:13.847 --> 00:01:14.528
I was an idiot.

00:01:15.744 --> 00:01:16.341
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> You were.

00:01:27.948 --> 00:01:29.851
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Now we’re in very different places.

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:31.731
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I think you’re right.

00:01:43.735 --> 00:01:44.840
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> So is this it?

00:01:47.636 --> 00:01:48.149
The end?

00:01:50.325 --> 00:01:51.034
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I think so.